    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Brand and identity designer, New York. Seniority: senior, Design Director-level. Former Design Director at COLLINS (Spotify, Twitch, Mailchimp identities). Confirmed projects she worked on there (from her own interview): the Girl Scouts of the USA rebrand (which she led over three years: brand platform, custom typeface Girl Scouts Serif, badge-inspired geometric system, apparel, product, art direction; ADC best-of-year), Equinox Hotels (hyper-minimalist luxury hotel brand) and More Than Magic (eccentric tween fashion brand for Target). High-res selections from all three shown. Now focused on Soon Foundation for the Arts (her current venture, on her site as On Soon / Erst) and teaches Design with Typography at SVA NYC. Autonomy 4 (estimate): led a multi-year flagship rebrand as Design Director, broad agency project range, now runs her own venture. Her personal site is conceptual and her Instagram is personal photography, so her identity work is shown from the COLLINS case studies. Capability: Identity systems. LinkedIn megan-bowker-9b309789; Instagram @meganbowker. Work Status: Studio/independent (Soon Foundation), ex-Collins. Jonathan notes she is former Collins; he does not know her personally, no rating yet.",
